阅读下面的程序，写出输出结果，并解释关键步骤。

```c
#include <stdio.h>
unsigned int factorial(unsigned int n) {
    if (n <= 1) {
        return 1;
    }
    return n * factorial(n - 1);
}
int main(void) {
    printf("%u\n", factorial(5));
    return 0;
}
```

